{"pageid":3480,"title":"Version 1.33.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.33.0</span>","revid":15617,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.33.0\">Version 1.33.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 2nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added brand new <a href=\"/wiki/Tape_Measure\" title=\"Tape Measure\">Tape Measure</a> tool! (can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine</a>)</li>\n<li>Added new vehicle color variant</li>\n<li>Added new atmosphere system in preparation for weather!</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The time system is no longer global</li>\n<li>Daytime and nighttime durations are adjusted, times currently unknown</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Misc bug fixes</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.33.1\">Version 1.33.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 2nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_2\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Temp Fix for drowning</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.33.2\">Version 1.33.2</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 2nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_3\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed floating numbers corresponding to the <a href=\"/wiki/Tape_Measure\" title=\"Tape Measure\">Tape Measure</a> UI</li>\n<li>Fixed drowning above the surface of the water</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.33.3\">Version 1.33.3</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 2nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_4\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed a large amount of bugs</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.33.4\">Version 1.33.4</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 2nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><spa